Package: telltale
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: bongomanuk <bongomanuk@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: TelltaleDNS - a fast, per-device filtering DNS resolver with a web UI
 Static ARM build for Asuswrt-Merlin/Entware. The web UI is embedded and
 there are no shared-library dependencies. Free port 53 (dnsmasq) before
 starting the service.
